      "comment": "GEORGE JUDY (1) pinged the lids from out wide but faded out of it late when 7th at this track in a Grade 4/5. Solid record here at the distance winning 10 races. Should be very hard to beat this time. JASPER DARKE (7) finished second last time (23.08) at this track after winning at his previous three outings. Expected to be in this for a long way. MY MOON SHADOW (2) turned spotting a big start finishing seventh (24.94) last time in a Mix 1/2/3 at this track. Has a good record here including 10 wins. Comes out of a solid form race last start. Should be about the money. SEMI PEAKIN' (6) should be thereabouts despite an unplaced run here most recently.",
